<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-News Corp year net profit drops.</title>
<headline>RTRS-News Corp year net profit drops.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>Operating profit (billion) 1.47 vs 1.36</p>
<p>    Net profit			720 vs 1,020</p>
<p>    Abnormal		   loss 575 vs loss 243</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	1.5 vs 1.5</p>
<p>NOTE: The News Corporation Ltd is a global multimedia organisation and is controlled by Rupert Murdoch. Analysts had forecast a net profit before abnormals of about A$1.42 billion.</p>
</text>
